        {
          "published_at": "2026-11-15T19:07:01.961Z",
          "url": "https://x.com/thorstenball/status/2122043714927210715",
          "topic": "Organizational readiness for AI-assisted development",
          "text": "Talked with three different companies last week: a very old bank, a 10-year-old startup, and a 8-year-old startup.\n\nShared my views on future of software development.\n\nTo my big surprise, it was the old bank that responded the most with \"yes, and...\"\n\nBoth startups, on the other hand, report they have people who really struggle with AI.\n\nSome of them still believe AI is a fad that will blow over (\"well, they can't do what *I* do\"), others haven't tried the latest models and don't know what SOTA is, some don't think anything changed really with AI.\n\nWild times.",
